      "message": "dsb(ishst) only orders this for an inner-shareable, cacheable command queue. On a non-coherent ITS the command must be cleaned to PoC instead, as the driver does in its_flush_cmd() (NEEDS_FLUSHING -\u003e gic_flush_dcache_to_poc, else dsb). And it\u0027s reachable: cbaser_write() forwards the host\u0027s Shareability/cacheability bits unmasked, so the hyp doesn\u0027t pin the shadow queue\u0027s attributes. Suggest forcing inner-shareable + cacheable on the shadow GITS_CBASER, then flushing when the ITS reports non-shareable.",
